  "rationale": "The posted agenda for Oct 8, 2013 (retained-agenda) is headed 'Regular Meeting of the City Council and/or Work Session of the City Council' for the Town of Addison, listing a 6:00 PM work session (Airport Strategic Plan) and a 7:30 PM regular meeting (pledge, consent agenda approving prior Council work session/regular/special meeting minutes, sign ordinance, Planning and Zoning Commission appointment, budget amendment). The provider player (provider-player) titles recording 55599 'Oct 08, 2013 Combined Meeting - Addison, TX', which the agenda shows is a single Council meeting combining its work session and regular meeting. The only convened body proven by supplied evidence is the Addison City Council: the Planning and Zoning Commission appears solely as the subject of Council appointment item R4, not as a convening participant, so no joint participant is proven and no additional feed applies. Assignment to the existing City Council feed follows the identity rule (convened body, not venue or topic) and the joints rule."
